Package: party.jailbreak.omega-ondevice
Name: Omega On-Device
Version: 1.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Keeps sideloaded apps valid on-device. Neutralises the local
 revocation state (OCSP cache + the four MobileIdentityData ban-lists, rewritten
 empty and locked immutable) and ships a localhost web control panel with
 buttons for Apply / Status / Log / Debug. Pair with a DNS block of
 ocsp/ppq/crl/valid.apple.com for the online side. Re-applies at every boot.
Author: jailbreak.party (on-device port)
Maintainer: Omega
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), python3
Tag: role::hacker
Depiction:
